    "howToApply": [
      "Check eligibility criteria carefully including educational qualification, age, and domicile/district requirements as per Annexure-1.",
      "For NAPS trades: Register and apply through the National Apprenticeship Promotion Scheme portal at https://apprenticeshipindia.gov.in (available from 29.10.2026).",
      "For NATS trades: Register and apply through the National Apprenticeship Training Scheme portal at https://nats.education.gov.in (available from 29.10.2026).",
      "Ensure all registration details, educational qualifications, and other particulars are correctly entered before submitting the application.",
      "A candidate can apply for only one trade and one work centre. If applications are submitted for more than one work centre/trade, apprenticeship will be allocated at one centre and for one trade only at management��s discretion.",
      "Regularly monitor the official ONGC website (www.ongcapprentices.ongc.co.in) and the respective NAPS/NATS portals for updates.",
      "Last date for receipt of applications: 20.11.2026."
